              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ElfinLeek8155"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I increased the bourbon to 7 Tbs so you could taste the bourbon, and used the large chunks of semi-sweet chocolate instead of morsels. Also, refrigerated the dough for a couple hours before baking so they wouldn’t spread as much. Delicious!!!",
